025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids shows October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years, more than any other pair. On that middle, 2025 ran 30% of normal in September to October and 37% in October to November. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 179% and June to July at 92%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, with grid 13381 at 51%.</p>"}
